<span class="line"><span style="color:#800000">/&gt;</span></span></code></pre>
<p>This button has creative-fill hover animation</p>
<a class="btn creative-hover-anim btn-primary effect-color-accent" href="/">Creative Fill<span class="hover-bg"></span></a>
