<p>This button has text-flip hover animation</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary text-flip-hover-anim" href="/"><span class="text-flip-inner" data-content="Text Flip">Text Flip</span><span class="translate-x-centered absolute -bottom-2 block h-7 w-36 transform-[matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)] blur-[10px]"><svg class="gradient-shape" width="150" height="28" viewBox="0 0 147 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.34766 30.8857L49.449 3.11433L97.5504 30.8857L145.652 3.11433" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8"></path></svg></span></a>
<p>This button has magnetic and text-flip together hover animation</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary text-flip-hover-anim magnetic-hover-anim" href="/" style="will-change: transform;"><span class="text-flip-inner" data-content="Magnetic With Text Flip">Magnetic With Text Flip</span><span class="translate-x-centered absolute -bottom-2 block h-7 w-36 transform-[matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)] blur-[10px]"><svg class="gradient-shape" width="150" height="28" viewBox="0 0 147 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.34766 30.8857L49.449 3.11433L97.5504 30.8857L145.652 3.11433" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8"></path></svg></span></a>
