<h3 class="h6" id="buttons-variants">Buttons Variants</h3>
<p>Each button color can be customize by adding <strong>class=“btn-accent”</strong> or <strong>class=“btn-light”</strong></p>
<pre class="astro-code light-plus" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#000000;overflow-x:auto" tabindex="0" data-language="jsx"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#800000">&lt;</span><span style="color:#267F99">CustomButton</span><span style="color:#E50000"> label</span><span style="color:#000000">=</span><span style="color:#A31515">"Example Button"</span><span style="color:#E50000"> url</span><span style="color:#000000">=</span><span style="color:#A31515">"/"</span><span style="color:#800000"> /&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#800000">&lt;</span><span style="color:#267F99">CustomButton</span><span style="color:#E50000"> class</span><span style="color:#000000">=</span><span style="color:#A31515">"btn-accent"</span><span style="color:#E50000"> label</span><span style="color:#000000">=</span><span style="color:#A31515">"Example Button"</span><span style="color:#E50000"> url</span><span style="color:#000000">=</span><span style="color:#A31515">"/"</span><span style="color:#800000"> /&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#800000">&lt;</span><span style="color:#267F99">CustomButton</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#E50000">  variant</span><span style="color:#000000">=</span><span style="color:#A31515">"outline"</span></span>
